eet any additional technical requirements stated by the course instructor</li>\\n</ul>", "showDiscount": true, "lessonDownload": false, "lessonTabsOrder": [{"id": 1, "name": "Note"}, {"id": 2, "name": "Slide"}, {"id": 3, "name": "Video"}]}	100	USD	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580927752452-89d86da3fa0a?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=550&q=80	f	t	plain	ACTIVE
Instagram Ads for Beginners	In this beginner-friendly course, learn how to effectively utilize Instagram ads to reach a wider audience, boost brand visibility, and drive conversions. Gain the skills needed to create compelling ads and optimize campaigns for maximum ROI.	# Introduction	18f88851-73ef-42ef-8d80-7e6e84b52da6	2023-09-24 17:30:12.781161+00	2023-09-24 17:30:12.781161+00	b13ecb3a-e922-41b9-814c-6623a439411d	t		instagramadsforbeginners-1695577338218	{"goals": "", "goals": "<h2>Course Objectives</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understand the basics of Instagram advertising and its benefits</li>\\n<li>Learn how to set up an Instagram ad campaign</li>\\n<li>Explore different ad formats available on Instagram</li>\\n<li>Master targeting and audience segmentation strategies</li>\\n<li>Learn how to create engaging ad content</li>\\n<li>Optimize ad performance and monitor key metrics</li>\\n<li>Discover advanced techniques for improving ad conversion rates</li>\\n<li>Gain insights into budgeting and bidding strategies</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Course Structure</h2>\\n<p>This course will be divided into several modules, with each module covering specific aspects of Instagram advertising. The lectures will be a combination of theoretical explanations, practical examples, and interactive activities to enhance learning.</p>\\n<h2>Who Should Attend</h2>\\n<p>This course is best suited for beginners who have little to no experience with Instagram advertising. It is suitable for individuals, entrepreneurs, small business owners, marketers, or anyone interested in leveraging Instagram as a powerful marketing tool.</p>\\n<h2>Prerequisites</h2>\\n<p>There are no specific prerequisites for this course. Basic knowledge of Instagram and familiarity with social media platforms will be helpful, but not mandatory. Students are expected to bring their own devices (laptop, smartphone) for practical exercises.</p>\\n<h2>Certification</h2>\\n<p>Upon successful completion of this course, students will receive a certificate of completion, showcasing their newly acquired skills in Instagram advertising.</p>", "description": "<h1>Instagram Ads for Beginners</h1>\\n<h2>Course Description</h2>\\n<p>In this course, we will unravel the power of Instagram ads and how they can be effectively used by beginners to promote their products or services. Instagram has become one of the leading social media platforms for businesses to reach their target audience and increase their brand visibility.</p>\\n<h2>Course Objectives</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understand the basics of Instagram advertising</li>\\n<li>Create compelling ad campaigns that resonate with the target audience</li>\\n<li>Master the art of crafting visually appealing ads on Instagram</li>\\n<li>Analyze ad performance using Instagram's analytical tools</li>\\n<li>Optimize ad campaigns to maximize results and return on investment</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Course Topics</h2>\\n<p>This course will cover the following topics:</p>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Introduction to Instagram advertising</li>\\n<li>Setting up an Instagram business account and ad account</li>\\n<li>Defining target audience and objectives for ad campaigns</li>\\n<li>Creating engaging and visually appealing ad content</li>\\n<li>Choosing the right ad formats for different campaign goals</li>\\n<li>Setting up ad targeting and placements</li>\\n<li>Managing ad budgets and bidding options</li>\\n<li>Analyzing ad performance and optimizing campaigns</li>\\n<li>Best practices for successful Instagram ads</li>\\n</ol>\\n<h2>Who Should Attend</h2>\\n<p>This course is designed for beginners who are new to Instagram advertising and want to acquire the necessary skills to effectively run ad campaigns on this platform. It is suitable for:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Entrepreneurs and small business owners</li>\\n<li>Marketing professionals</li>\\n<li>Social media managers</li>\\n<li>Digital marketers</li>\\n<li>Anyone interested in learning about Instagram advertising</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Course Duration</h2>\\n<p>The course will be covered over a span of 4 weeks, with 2 classes per week. Each class will be 2 hours long.</p>", "requirements": "<h3>Prerequisites</h3>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Basic computer literacy</li>\\n<li>Familiarity with Instagram</li>\\n<li>Access to a personal or business Instagram account</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h3>Hardware Requirements</h3>\\n<ul>\\n<li>A desktop computer or laptop</li>\\n<li>Reliable internet connection</li>\\n<li>A webcam and microphone (for live sessions or video discussions)</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h3>Software Requirements</h3>\\n<ul>\\n<li>An up-to-date web browser (e.g., Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox)</li>\\n<li>Access to Instagram's ads platform</li>\\n<li>A text editor (optional but recommended for note-taking)</li>\\n<li>A screen recording software (optional but recommended for practical demonstrations)</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h3>Course Materials</h3>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Handouts and lecture slides (provided by the instructor)</li>\\n<li>Recommended reading materials or online resources (shared during the course)</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h3>Time Commitment</h3>\\n<p>The course is estimated to require approximately X hours per week in total, including class time, individual study, and practical exercises. The exact duration may vary depending on the student's pace of learning.</p>\\n<h3>Evaluation and Assessment</h3>\\n<p>Students will be evaluated based on their performance in:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Participation in class discussions and activities (e.g., question and answer sessions, group projects)</li>\\n<li>Completion of assignments and practical exercises</li>\\n<li>An optional final exam or project</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h3>Attendance Policy</h3>\\n<p>Regular attendance is expected for all course sessions. If a student is unable to attend a session, they are responsible for catching up on missed material and assignments.</p>\\n<h3>Course Completion</h3>\\n<p>Upon successful completion of the course and meeting all requirements, students will receive a certificate of completion.</p>"}	0	NGN	\N	f	f	professional	ACTIVE
Figjam tutorial	Greetings and welcome to the Figjam Tutorial! This course aims to familiarize you with Figjam and equip you with the necessary skills to effectively utilize this collaborative online whiteboard tool.\n\nThroughout this course, you will be introduced to the fundamentals of Figjam, which include learning how to create and organize boards, utilize the various features and tools, and collaborate with others in real-time.	# Introduction	398a1d41-eda9-4e64-87ce-18eda76addf9	2023-09-23 22:33:12.47213+00	2023-09-23 22:33:12.47213+00	fcd97649-054e-4104-94e0-c8b3231c228f	t	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585231059875-65414c63f26d?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w1MTE1NTV8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwyMnx8ZmlnbWF8ZW58MHx8fHwxNjk2NDk3MzA4fDA&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&q=80&w=1080	figjamtutorial-1695509287848	{"grading": false, "requirements": "<p>Welcome to the Figjam Tutorial course! In this course, you will learn how to effectively use Figjam, a collaborative whiteboarding tool offered by Figma. The course is designed to help you master the various features and functionalities of Figjam, enabling you to effectively communicate and collaborate with others during your creative process.</p>\\n<h2>Course Requirements</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>A device with internet access</li>\\n<li>A Figma account (Sign up for free at <a href=\\"https://figma.com/\\">https://figma.com/</a>)</li>\\n<li>A stable internet connection</li>\\n<li>Basic computer literacy skills</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Recommended</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>A computer with a reliable processing power</li>\\n<li>A microphone and speakers or headphones for enhanced interaction</li>\\n<li>A webcam for potential video conferences</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Expectations</h2>\\n<p>To successfully complete the Figjam Tutorial course, you should:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Attend all scheduled classes or complete the online modules</li>\\n<li>Actively participate in class activities and discussions</li>\\n<li>Complete assigned tasks and projects on time</li>\\n<li>Seek help and clarification when needed</li>\\n<li>Demonstrate an understanding of course materials through assessments</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Assessment</h2>\\n<p>Assessment for the Figjam Tutorial course will be based on the following:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Class participation: 20%</li>\\n<li>Assignments: 40%</li>\\n<li>Final project: 40%</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Please note that in order to receive a certificate of completion, all course requirements including attendance and completion of assessments must be met.</p>", "lessonDownload": false, "lessonTabsOrder": [{"id": 3, "name": "Video"}, {"id": 2, "name": "Slide"}, {"id": 1, "name": "Note"}]}	0	NGN	\N	f	f	professional	ACTIVE
