HTML for Absolute Beginners	This course is specifically designed for individuals with no prior coding experience. Learn the fundamentals of HTML, the building blocks of web development, in a beginner-friendly and accessible manner.	Welcome to this amazing course 🚀 	194a3c8a-bc27-4c8a-8c60-444481ba9640	2023-10-15 11:58:46.253245+00	2023-10-15 11:58:46.253245+00	ebb6cd3b-fbbb-4d9a-9981-a2d462b110d5	t	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590608897129-79da98d15969?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w1MTE1NTV8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxN3x8aHRtbHxlbnwwfHx8fDE2OTczNzE2Mzl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&q=80&w=1080	htmlforabsolutebeginners-1697371696403	{"goals": "", "goals": "<p>HTML for Absolute Beginners is a course designed to introduce students to the fundamentals of HTML. By the end of this course, students should expect to learn the following:</p>\\n<ol>\\n<li>The basic structure of an HTML document</li>\\n<li>How to create headings, paragraphs, and line breaks</li>\\n<li>How to add images and hyperlinks to web pages</li>\\n<li>How to create lists (both ordered and unordered)</li>\\n<li>How to use HTML tables to display data</li>\\n<li>How to create forms and capture user input</li>\\n<li>How to embed multimedia content like audio and video</li>\\n<li>How to add comments to the HTML code for documentation Please note that this is an introductory course, so students will gain a basic understanding of HTML syntax and essential tags. Building upon this foundation, they will be equipped to move on to more advanced topics in web development.</li>\\n</ol>", "reward": {"show": false}, "grading": false, "discount": "10", "instructor": {"name": "Rotimi Best", "role": "Senior Software Engineer", "imgUrl": "https://pgrest.classroomio.com/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/course/194a3c8a-bc27-4c8a-8c60-444481ba96401697371872755.webp", "courseNo": "20", "description": "I am passionate about teaching and helping others grow in their dev journey."}, "description": "<p>Welcome to the HTML for Absolute Beginners course! This course is designed for individuals who have little to no prior experience with HTML and are interested in learning how to build and design web pages from scratch.</p>\\n<p>Throughout this course, you will be introduced to the fundamental concepts of HTML (Hypertext Markup Language) - the standard markup language used for creating web pages. You will learn the essential tags, attributes, and elements required to structure and format content on a webpage.</p>\\n<h4>Course Objectives:</h4>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Understand the basics of HTML and its role in web development</li>\\n<li>Create well-structured HTML documents using the appropriate tags and elements</li>\\n<li>Insert various types of content, such as text, images, hyperlinks, and lists, into webpages</li>\\n<li>Format and style webpages using inline styles and basic HTML tags</li>\\n<li>Master the concept of HTML forms and create user-friendly input fields</li>\\n<li>Integrate multimedia elements, including videos and audio, into webpages</li>\\n<li>Learn best practices for optimizing HTML code for search engines</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Course Content:</h2>\\n<ol>\\n<li><strong>Introduction to HTML:</strong> Understanding the purpose and structure of HTML, creating a basic HTML document, and exploring different HTML versions.</li>\\n<li><strong>Text Formatting:</strong> Formatting text using HTML tags such as headings, paragraphs, emphasis, and strong.</li>\\n<li><strong>Hyperlinks and Navigation:</strong> Creating hyperlinks to navigate between webpages and linking to external websites.</li>\\n<li><strong>Images and Multimedia:</strong> Inserting and formatting images, adding videos and audio to webpages.</li>\\n<li><strong>Lists and Tables:</strong> Creating ordered and unordered lists, creating tables to display data.</li>\\n<li><strong>HTML Forms:</strong> Building interactive forms, understanding form validation, and submitting form data.</li>\\n<li><strong>Page Layout and Structure:</strong> Designing well-organized web pages using HTML tags for headers, footers, div, and span.</li>\\n<li><strong>Search Engine Optimization (SEO):</strong> Understanding SEO basics and applying HTML techniques to improve search engine rankings.</li>\\n</ol>\\n<h2>Prerequisites:</h2>\\n<p>This course does not require any prior knowledge of HTML or web development. However, basic familiarity with using a computer and browsing the internet is beneficial.</p>\\n<p>By the end of this course, you will have a solid understanding of HTML and be able to create simple, functional web pages. Whether you aspire to become a web developer or just want to explore the world of web design, this course will serve as a great starting point for your journey.</p>", "requirements": "<ul>\\n<li>A computer or laptop with an internet connection</li>\\n<li>A web browser (such as Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, or Safari)</li>\\n<li>A text editor for writing HTML code (e.g. Notepad++, Sublime Text, or Visual Studio Code)</li>\\n<li>Basic computer literacy skills and familiarity with using a keyboard and mouse</li>\\n<li>No prior knowledge of HTML or programming is required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Please make sure that you have access to the aforementioned requirements before starting the course.</p>", "showDiscount": true, "lessonDownload": false, "allowNewStudent": false, "lessonTabsOrder": [{"id": 3, "name": "Video"}, {"id": 1, "name": "Note"}, {"id": 2, "name": "Slide"}]}	100	USD	\N	t	f	professional	ACTIVE
SQL For Beginners: Learn Backend Development with Supabase	This comprehensive 3-week course is designed to take absolute beginners from zero knowledge of SQL to becoming proficient with the Supabase platform. You'll learn the essential concepts and skills needed to build powerful, data-driven web applications using Supabase, all while understanding the fundamentals of SQL.	<p>Welcome to this amazing course 🚀&nbsp;</p>	a25904dd-cee0-442f-ac3a-a1103fc8e4c8	2023-10-11 11:01:03.561389+00	2023-10-11 11:01:03.561389+00	fae9882f-5eeb-4a32-90c0-423f51a4007b	t	https://pgrest.classroomio.com/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/uploadwidget/1699652252618CIO%20Cover.png	zero-to-supabase-hero-mastering-sql-and-postgres-with-supabase-1697787114921	{"goals": "", "grading": false, "description": "", "requirements": "", "lessonDownload": false, "allowNewStudent": false, "lessonTabsOrder": [{"id": 1, "name": "Note"}, {"id": 2, "name": "Slide"}, {"id": 3, "name": "Video"}]}	0	NGN	\N	f	f	professional	ACTIVE
