# Lesson Outline: Duck Duck Go vs Google Chrome\n## Lesson Title: How Google destroyed us\n\nI. Introduction\n   - Explanation of the course title and lesson topic\n   - Brief overview of Duck Duck Go and Google Chrome\n\nII. Understanding Search Engines\n   - Definition and purpose of search engines\n   - Importance of search engines in our digital lives\n\nIII. Introducing Duck Duck Go\n   - History, features, and advantages of Duck Duck Go\n   - Privacy-focused approach and its significance\n   - Comparisons with Google Chrome's search engine\n\nIV. Analyzing Google Chrome\n   - Overview of Google Chrome's search engine\n   - Dominance in the search engine market\n   - Privacy concerns and data collection practices\n   - Impact on user privacy and the society at large\n\nV. Privacy Concerns and Data Collection\n   - Deep dive into data collection by Google Chrome\n   - Understanding different types of data collected\n   - Implications of personalized search results and targeted advertising\n\nVI. Benefits of Using Duck Duck Go\n   - Enhanced privacy features of Duck Duck Go\n   - Ability to maintain anonymity while browsing\n   - Protection against personalized ads and tracking\n\nVII. Making a Choice: Duck Duck Go or Google Chrome\n   - Factors to consider when choosing a search engine\n   - Personal preferences, privacy concerns, and security implications\n   - Pros and cons of each search engine\n\nVIII. Conclusion\n   - Summary of key points discussed\n   - Encouragement to explore alternatives and make an informed decision\n   - Closing thoughts on the impact of search engines on our online experience\n\nNote: This outline is meant to serve as a guide for the lesson and can be adjusted or expanded upon based on the desired duration and depth of the course.	https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0e3GPea1Tyg	\N	3b0813b4-c887-4f71-8ab6-7de1896d6777	109b1e22-d6a6-4c03-b3e7-0cb18dc86256	2023-08-03 02:01:18.763593+00	2023-08-05 09:39:24.123018+00	How Google destroyed us	